      "content": "wow that's intense. i had a feeling something was up but i didn't realize it was that organized. if they're using the plants to focus the sound like that, how would they actually record it without anyone seeing anything? like, i dont see any wires or speakers, so how does the audio actually get from the plants to whoever is listening?",
